      "text": "We report Recall@1000 for both datasets, as well\nas the official metrics MRR@10 and NDCG@10 for MS MARCO dev\n\nThanks to the additional sparse expansion mechanism, we are able\nto obtain results on par with state-of-the-art dense approaches on\nMS MARCO dev set\n\nSPLADE reaches efficiency levels equivalent to sparse BOW models, while outperforming doc2query-T5\n\nExperiments show that the expansion\nbrings improvements w.r.t. to the purely lexical approach by increasing recall. Additionally, representations\nobtained from expansionregularized models are sparser: the models learn how to balance\nexpansion and compression, by both turning-off irrelevant dimensions and activating useful ones.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We report Recall@1000 for both datasets, as well\nas the official metrics MRR@10 and NDCG@10 for MS MARCO dev\n\nThanks to the additional sparse expansion mechanism, we are able\nto obtain results on par with state-of-the-art dense approaches on\nMS MARCO dev set\n\nSPLADE reaches efficiency levels equivalent to sparse BOW models, while outperforming doc2query-T5\n\nExperiments show that the expansion\nbrings improvements w.r.t. to the purely lexical approach by increasing recall. Additionally, representations obtained from expansionregularized models are sparser: the models learn how to balance\nexpansion and compression, by both turning-off irrelevant dimensions and activating useful ones.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "fyf7gGC4PI3SPtDG4IoM_",
      "type": "image",
      "x": 1028.4975849718323,
      "y": 6769.522197818935,
      "width": 727.0322085889571,
      "height": 356.40977443609023,
